@startuml D07_stm_product
!include _style.iuml
title D07 State machine: product slot lifecycle (SPEC 6.4 'S')
[*] --> PREOPEN
PREOPEN --> OPEN : S(OPEN, anchor, gc)\n[live == 0] / anchor := price, gc := oid\n[live > 0] / err_anchor++
OPEN --> HALT : S(HALT)
HALT --> OPEN : S(OPEN) / keep anchor
OPEN --> CLOSED : S(CLOSED) at gate closure
HALT --> CLOSED : S(CLOSED)
CLOSED --> PREOPEN : S(PREOPEN) [slot reuse]\n/ fv_valid := 0, pos := 0, last_px := NONE\n[live > 0] / err_anchor++
OPEN : A/X/E/M update book\nstrategy armed if fv_valid
CLOSED : exchange purges book (X)\nno orders
note right of PREOPEN : S with code > 3:\nerr_bad_state, ignored (D-11)
@enduml
